From bf981424cf8bd01f5cd5cab6c511dbb9bb02143e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: XCH27 <49464716+XCH27@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 11:03:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Plugin Market filters by what packages contain; own items are
 labelled Custom (OV-100)

Catalog entries rarely declare their contents (none of the official or
sampled reference marketplace entries do), so packages already on disk are
inspected and cached by root and manifest time; remote packages stay unknown
and appear only under All. Settings views label the person's own Skills, MCP
servers, commands and hooks Custom instead of Installed. The internal
node_repl host is hidden from the Market as it already was from Settings and
the catalog count.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
